Any six of the following ways of maintaining good health:
- a **balanced diet**;
- **personal hygiene**;
- **regular exercise**, and practising **yoga**;
- **vaccination** (immunisation) against infectious diseases;
- **proper disposal of wastes**;
- **control of vectors** such as mosquitoes;
